','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Transformer核心作者Noam Shazeer正式加盟OpenAI，谷歌未能挽留</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Midjourney跨界医疗领域，联合Butterfly Network推出全身超声扫描仪</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic为Claude筹备语音模式升级，新增多语言支持并测试通话式交互</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里联合人大开源多领域科学生成基础模型LOGOS</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1bc875d1e963cfbae78a451e577f1de8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月18日，阿里ATH-Token Foundry联合中国人民大学高瓴人工智能学院正式开源多领域科学生成基础模型LOGOS。该模型通过共享词表将蛋白质、抗体、小分子及MOF材料等异构对象统一编码为离散Token序列，无需依赖昂贵的3D空间信息，即可通过序列预测构建复杂的3D空间互作规律，打破了科学领域的数据孤岛。在参数效率方面，LOGOS-1B版本仅用1/56的参数量，在多项科学任务中超越了微软NatureLM。该模型解决了预训练与下游任务的目标偏差，支持无需微调直接激活生成能力。目前，项目组已构建包含7类模态、总计44.87B tokens的预训练语料库，并已在HuggingFace与GitHub开源模型权重、推理代码及技术报告。LOGOS的推出为科研自动化提供了高效引擎，降低了多模态科学大模型的开发门槛，为</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">演语科技完成近3亿美元B+轮融资，估值超20亿美元且ARR突破3亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5e735455b3801bbc6f86372d7af63e1c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">演语科技（Evoken）近日完成近3亿美元B+轮融资，投后估值超20亿美元，本轮由Granite Asia、腾讯、顺为资本联合领投，老股东高榕资本、蚂蚁集团等跟投。截至2026年5月，公司ARR突破3亿美元，5月集团整体收入同比增长超3000%，核心营收源自短剧、影视及广告等专业内容生产者的真实预算。演语科技已构建三条核心产品线：拥有超3000万用户及50万原创模型的AI图片创作社区LiblibAI、服务近千个团队的AI视频创作平台LibTV，以及服务超千万用户的AI设计Agent“星流”。这三者串联起素材、生产到交付的完整AI内容链路。此次融资标志着演语科技跻身Runway、ElevenLabs等全球AI内容赛道第一梯队，其跨场景整合能力打破了单一赛道局限，推动AI应用从单纯比拼生成质量转向比拼工作流生产链路</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Transformer核心作者Noam Shazeer正式加盟OpenAI，谷歌未能挽留</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Transformer架构核心作者、AI领域顶尖研究员Noam Shazeer近日正式宣布加入OpenAI。Shazeer曾是谷歌Gemini项目的技术负责人，此前谷歌曾于2024年斥资约27亿美元通过技术许可协议将其召回，但此次他选择再次离开。作为《Attention Is All You Need》论文的主要作者，Shazeer被业界誉为“巫师”，在现代大模型核心技术研发方面具有奠基性贡献。此次变动后，Transformer论文的八位原始作者已全部离开谷歌，其中两人现已落脚OpenAI。Shazeer的加入将为OpenAI的研发团队注入关键技术力量，进一步加剧了顶级AI人才在行业巨头间的流动与竞争，对后续大模型架构的迭代与技术演进产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Midjourney跨界医疗领域，联合Butterfly Network推出全身超声扫描仪</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/657c7a80890c9b5539af8df4d9b02e9d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI图像生成平台Midjourney正式跨界医疗健康领域，推出首款硬件产品Midjourney Scanner。该设备由Midjourney与超声技术公司Butterfly Network合作开发，集成了40个超声芯片成像模块。用户通过站入浅水池并穿过环形传感器结构，系统利用数千个换能器发射超声波，在约60秒内通过2 PFLOPS算力重建出媲美核磁共振质量的体内三维图像。Midjourney计划于2027年底前在旧金山开设配套体检水疗中心并部署约10台设备。目前该项目聚焦于身体构成图，暂不涉及医疗诊断功能，若未来用于临床诊断仍需通过美国FDA审批。该设备提供无辐射的内部成像体验，旨在让用户更便捷地获取身体数据，公司承诺将在正式落地前公布详尽的数据政策。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic为Claude筹备语音模式升级，新增多语言支持并测试通话式交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正对其AI助手Claude进行语音模式重大升级，核心在于打破语言壁垒并优化交互逻辑。根据iOS版Claude应用设置界面显示，该功能将新增对中文、粤语、日语、德语、西班牙语、葡萄牙语、俄语及乌克兰语的支持，彻底改变此前仅支持英语的现状。在交互模式上，Claude新增了“按下通话”模式，用户需长按按钮进行语音输入，并保留了支持连续对话的“免提”模式。此外，应用界面中出现的电话听筒图标暗示Anthropic正尝试打造更接近传统通话的即时交互体验。此次更新旨在提升Claude在多语言环境下的可用性，通过更精细的交互控制，使AI对话体验更趋近于人际交流，目前该功能仍处于酝酿阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
